"Mirrors the VRP2 web app toggle 'Zaokrúhľovať na 5 centov'. When on, paid totals are rounded to the nearest 5 cents and the difference is reported in the receipt's roundingAmount/useRounding.\n"
"This is a CLIENT-SIDE preference in the VRP2 web app (confirmed: toggling it sends nothing to the server and never appears in any API request/response), so it is configured here per register."
msgstr ""

